  "registration": "The shipped catalogue card for Tilt-Up Light-Industrial Workshop fixes material, massing and identity. The deterministic geometry owns openings, structure, roof and silhouette: 60 m by 35 m one-storey industrial envelope; complete tilt-up panel modules and joints wrap all sides, a recessed two-level office marks the public front, exactly four deep loading portals line the service side and every canopy and bollard is grounded.",
